{"id":294,"slug":"filter-020","category_slug":"filter","name":"可重置筛选条件","description":"选项单选与重置","tags":["Filter","交互","筛选","暗黑模式","antd","iOS","Linear","极简"],"preview_html":"\n<div style=\"padding:20px;max-width:260px\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;margin-bottom:8px\">分类</div>\n  <div class=\"fbar\" onclick=\"var it=event.target.closest('.f');if(!it)return;this.querySelectorAll('.f').forEach(function(x){x.style.background='#f5f5f5';x.style.color='#666'});it.style.background='#e6f4ff';it.style.color='#1677ff'\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px\">\n    <span class=\"f\" style=\"padding:4px 12px;background:#e6f4ff;color:#1677ff;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer\">全部</span>\n    <span class=\"f\" style=\"padding:4px 12px;background:#f5f5f5;color:#666;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer\">前端</span>\n    <span class=\"f\" style=\"padding:4px 12px;background:#f5f5f5;color:#666;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer\">设计</span>\n    <span class=\"f\" style=\"padding:4px 12px;background:#f5f5f5;color:#666;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer\">产品</span>\n  </div>\n  <button onclick=\"var bar=this.parentNode.querySelector('.fbar');var fs=bar.querySelectorAll('.f');fs.forEach(function(x,i){x.style.background=i===0?'#e6f4ff':'#f5f5f5';x.style.color=i===0?'#1677ff':'#666'})\" style=\"margin-top:12px;padding:6px 14px;border:1px solid #d9d9d9;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer\">重置</button>\n</div>","prompt":"设计可重置筛选条件：标签单选高亮，重置按钮回到\"全部\"。","prompt_short":"可重置筛选条件：选项单选与重置 风格 Filter / 交互 / 筛选 / 暗黑模式","sort":10,"category_name":"筛选面板","category_group":"基础控件","prompt_refactor":"把现有页面里的「可重置筛选条件」改成这个观感，只改样式，不重写。\n\n技术栈：按我项目现有的（Vue / Quasar 或 React / Tailwind 均可），不要升级版本，不要引入新依赖。\n\n参照描述：\n设计可重置筛选条件：标签单选高亮，重置按钮回到\"全部\"。\n\n约束：\n1. props 名称、数据字段、组件层级一律不动，只调整布局 / 间距 / 字号 / 颜色 / 圆角 / 阴影\n2. 需要动效时用项目已有能力降级实现，不新增动画库\n3. 先给 2-3 个方向（每个方向改了什么、风险在哪），我确认后再出代码\n4. 出代码时给完整单文件版本，不要给 diff\n验收：功能不变，构建能过。风格关键词：Filter / 交互 / 筛选 / 暗黑模式 / antd / iOS","url":"/v/filter-020/","md_url":"/api/v/filter-020.md","related":[{"slug":"filter-001","name":"移动端多层菜单筛选面板","tags":["移动端","电商","筛选"]},{"slug":"filter-002","name":"顶部筛选栏","tags":["Filter","筛选","列表"]},{"slug":"filter-003","name":"侧边筛选面板","tags":["Filter","侧边","面板"]},{"slug":"filter-004","name":"价格区间筛选","tags":["Filter","价格","区间"]},{"slug":"filter-005","name":"标签筛选","tags":["Filter","标签","云"]},{"slug":"filter-006","name":"多选筛选面板","tags":["Filter","多选","面板"]}]}